  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Hornet Nest</Major>
    <Description>For the macro to work, the previous attack must be critical. the probability of being critical is slightly above 3000, which is your critical probability, which is approximately 50%. in addition to providing more damage if the purple skill is used, it is important to use purple prickly stance and blue briar patch if you can use it next to the macro. the use of the 3 key hive swarm will be very helpful for the macro, which has a little trouble with focus regeneration, to be effective.

Enjoy!</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download </Comment>
